# Optional root for caches, temporary files, and build output. Defaults to the
# ignored .cache directory in this repository. Set this to a spacious filesystem
# before creating image-mirror packages. Relative paths resolve from the
# repository root.
# CACHE_DIR=/path/to/cache

# Optional default destination for `just copy` and `just copy-all`; a positional
# destination overrides it. The recipes replace only the `coder-workspaces`
# directory below this existing writable destination.
# RELEASE_DESTINATION=/path/to/transport-media
